{"id":"n16241-2-7","stage":2,"title":"서늘하다 · 胆颤","scene":"自然与环境","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n16241-2-7-1","ko":"한밤중에 고양이가 울 때마다 가슴이 서늘해.","zh":"每当半夜听到猫叫，我就觉得心里发毛。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"한밤중에","meaning":"深夜，午夜，大半夜，大晚上，深更半夜","explanation":"한밤중：深夜，午夜，大半夜，大晚上，深更半夜；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"한밤중","audio":"/audio/8526619eaddea12eaa8a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"84904","senseId":"1","lemma":"한밤중","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"한밤중에","audio":"/audio/be52601331c1de3aa2b0.mp3"}},{"text":"고양이가","meaning":"猫","explanation":"고양이：猫；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"고양이","audio":"/audio/2c4930ad509e4bdce9b3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"18779","senseId":"1","lemma":"고양이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"고양이가","audio":"/audio/a659c9673b9a892adb5e.mp3"}},{"text":"울","meaning":"啼，鸣，嚎叫","explanation":"울다：啼，鸣，嚎叫；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"울다","audio":"/audio/7136d2464083681e4841.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69523","senseId":"2","lemma":"울다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"울","audio":"/audio/6d63e6bd450f4a115772.mp3"}},{"text":"때마다","meaning":"时，时候","explanation":"때：时，时候；마다：表示“每、每逢”。","readings":[{"term":"때","audio":"/audio/43bc9c47e0f938b11288.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74123","senseId":"1","lemma":"때","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"때마다","audio":"/audio/1e35b901eccff392fa42.mp3"}},{"text":"가슴이","meaning":"心，心情，内心","explanation":"가슴：心，心情，内心；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"가슴","audio":"/audio/1bfa2a79f54c02d83437.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62908","senseId":"3","lemma":"가슴","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"가슴이","audio":"/audio/df6f423237a54255dcc1.mp3"}},{"text":"서늘해.","meaning":"胆颤，胆寒，心惊","explanation":"서늘하다：胆颤，胆寒，心惊；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"서늘하다","audio":"/audio/839cbf28fd9b94c982a0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"16241","senseId":"2","lemma":"서늘하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"서늘해","audio":"/audio/83b87fe14201b8593bce.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"8526619eaddea12e","term":"한밤중","zh":"深夜，午夜，大半夜，大晚上，深更半夜","audio":"/audio/8526619eaddea12eaa8a.mp3","entryId":"84904","definition":"很深的夜。","pronunciation":["한밤쭝"]},{"id":"2c4930ad509e4bdc","term":"고양이","zh":"猫","audio":"/audio/2c4930ad509e4bdce9b3.mp3","entryId":"18779","definition":"一种可以家养的小动物，在黑暗的地方也能看清事物，擅长捉老鼠。","pronunciation":["고양이"]},{"id":"7136d2464083681e","term":"울다","zh":"啼，鸣，嚎叫","audio":"/audio/7136d2464083681e4841.mp3","entryId":"69523","definition":"动物、昆虫、风等发出声音。","pronunciation":["울ː다"]},{"id":"43bc9c47e0f938b1","term":"때","zh":"时，时候","audio":"/audio/43bc9c47e0f938b11288.mp3","entryId":"74123","definition":"指某一瞬间或时间段。","pronunciation":["때"]},{"id":"1bfa2a79f54c02d8","term":"가슴","zh":"心，心情，内心","audio":"/audio/1bfa2a79f54c02d83437.mp3","entryId":"62908","definition":"心理或感受。","pronunciation":["가슴"]},{"id":"839cbf28fd9b94c9","term":"서늘하다","zh":"胆颤，胆寒，心惊","audio":"/audio/839cbf28fd9b94c982a0.mp3","entryId":"16241","definition":"突然吓了一跳或感到害怕而身体略微发凉。","pronunciation":["서늘하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/636f6cad43c1d9eac9b3.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n16241-2-7-2","ko":"혼자서 무섭겠다.","zh":"你一个人肯定很害怕吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"혼자서","meaning":"独自，单独","explanation":"혼자：独自，单独；서：接在人数表达等后，强调这些人是动作的主体，如 혼자서（独自）。","readings":[{"term":"혼자","audio":"/audio/9d309cd460ea409c50fb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30207","senseId":"1","lemma":"혼자","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"혼자서","audio":"/audio/870e79ede59f7c40d822.mp3"}},{"text":"무섭겠다.","meaning":"怕，害怕，可怕，恐惧","explanation":"무섭다：怕，害怕，可怕，恐惧；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断。；다：平叙句末，常用于书面叙述、自言自语或非敬语表达。","readings":[{"term":"무섭다","audio":"/audio/6c5692ebced898c0376c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"55637","senseId":"1","lemma":"무섭다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"무섭겠다","audio":"/audio/3af2d2432dce50af368e.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"9d309cd460ea409c","term":"혼자","zh":"独自，单独","audio":"/audio/9d309cd460ea409c50fb.mp3","entryId":"30207","definition":"只有一人，没有别人。","pronunciation":["혼자"]},{"id":"6c5692ebced898c0","term":"무섭다","zh":"怕，害怕，可怕，恐惧","audio":"/audio/6c5692ebced898c0376c.mp3","entryId":"55637","definition":"忌讳某个对象或担心出什么事。","pronunciation":["무섭따"]}],"audio":"/audio/cbb5014e2bfd57520f4f.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":1.925,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=16241","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"2","sourceLevel":"중급","day":66,"sequenceScore":1.6503,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["你一个人肯定很害怕吧。","你会骑摩托车吗？","每当半夜听到猫叫，我就觉得心里发毛。"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["你一个人肯定很害怕吧。","每当半夜听到猫叫，我就觉得心里发毛。","你会骑摩托车吗？"],"answer":0}]}
